            "notes": "The main idea of this deck is to use the aggressive strategy of Aragorn, King of Gondor, as the commander to dominate the opponent in a Duel Commander 1 vs 1 format. The deck includes a mix of powerful creatures, removal spells, countermagic, and card draw to control the battlefield and push for damage. The deck has a strong mana base with dual lands and fetch lands to ensure consistent mana production. The inclusion of high-value cards like Hullbreacher, Teferi, Time Raveler, and Snapcaster Mage adds versatility and disruption to the strategy. Overall, the deck aims to apply early pressure, disrupt the opponent's plans, and close out the game quickly with Aragorn leading the charge."
